3. One week, every policy, identical patient stream
-------------------------------------------------------
  Because the patient stream is generated up front, all five runs see exactly the same arrivals, triage levels, service times and exam requirements.  Every difference below is caused by scheduling alone.

  Per-patient waiting time (min) and KPIs -- single replication
  policy  W_total   W_L3   W_L4  init L3  init L4  follow  SL3 %  SL4 %  util %  done  unfin   sec
  ------  -------  -----  -----  -------  -------  ------  -----  -----  ------  ----  -----  ----
  IFP       60.55  59.87  60.78     1.85     4.24   98.14  100.0  100.0    88.8  2290     27  0.06
  ALT       49.73   6.86  64.30     3.30    61.21    5.47  100.0   82.9    88.8  2295     22  0.06
  SBP       53.14  16.58  65.58     5.65    51.27   23.02  100.0   86.2    88.8  2297     20  0.08
  WSEPT     50.13   4.04  65.80     1.75    63.47    3.96  100.0   83.0    88.8  2297     20  0.05
  GCMU      51.47  16.48  63.36     4.53    51.49   20.37  100.0   87.7    88.8  2296     21  0.08

  W_total / W_L3 / W_L4 are per-PATIENT totals (initial + follow-up wait); 'init' and 'follow' columns break that down per consultation.


